### CRAWL (nova/crawl.py)
- Same-host directory exploration without network calls
- Produces temporary chunks for optional web enqueue
- TUI command: `/crawl URL`
- Daemon job: `crawl:URL` drains into ingest/tick
- Flow: crawl -> temp chunks -> board.enqueue_url -> web.fetch -> 0x-WEB or Tx-REJECT

### RAG GATE (nova/rag.py)
- Word/subject-weight search across palace knowledge
- Small model (qwen2:0.5b) INCLUDE/EXCLUDE filtering before large-prompt context
- Ax-RAG stamp on kept snippets; noise removed from conversation context
- Source facts stay written; only filtered excerpts enter prompt window
- Goal: deepen base with Textual + Qt docs first, then arXiv white papers later

