## 2026-09-27 Fieldkit 2.0 — tidying cut opened (operator greenlight)
Authority: operator · Construction: Varro · 2IC: Cassius (diagrams/docs only; no metal without Varro)

### Decision
Codebase needs cleanup. First formal refactorization: STAGING-proven work → unified Fieldkit **2.0** tree. Do not break live GUI/TUI/daemon/mail/palace paths. Overlay + smoke; backup data/NOVA.db before schema moves.

### Why (sprawl snapshot)
- Live package: nova/ (~50 modules) + gui/ + tui/ + hands/awareness — working but crowded aliases.
- Legacy parallel: <legacy nova-ai tree> (nova_Tv3, diary, terminals) still referenced mentally; diary rewrite lands in a local STAGING/diary for 0x-DOC.
- STAGING: large proven stack (tentacle, mail schema, ingest_pipe, RAG gate, parser speech, OG digester, pets, hearthbeat) waiting fold-in.
- GUI deck.json: many tiles live but several are **aliases** to same panels (ingest/jobs/webgate→ops; claw/qwen→mail; status→spawn); dead: KILL, TUI, PAPER. Feels non-logical.
- Speech: GRAMMAR says one short sentence; models still misfire tags → upgrade parser already in nova/parser.py must be the single path + system-prompt load tightened.
- Mail: HEARTHBEAT schema exists but notes still say UDP; OG live is **TCP** 41776/41777 framed JSON. Standardize + Claw tentacle-mail tool.
- OG drain: bumped to smollm2:360m 2026-09-27; local WHI NOVA_NODE.db; haul routine still paused.

### SOP (unchanged)
- AI changes: one paragraph here (DEVLOG.ai) + one line DEVLOG.txt.
- Cycle audit: append <NOVA parent>/GrokBot.log.ai.
- Staging docs may be wrong; never mutate palace from staging alone.

### Fieldkit 2.0 target folders (neat, no function break)
`
NOVA_fieldkit_v2/   (or in-place bump VERSION→2.0.0 after PROOF)
  nova/
    core/       # brain, router, parser, msg, db, thermal, breaklog
    mail/       # office, hearthbeat, leash, claw bridge, tentacle client
    knowledge/  # rag, whi, ingest_pipe, docs_ingest, crawl, masks, matrix
    senses/     # pocket, ear_stt, avatar_display, senses, snap
    agents/     # claw, forge, chamber, council_series, sched, homestead
    hands/      # web, pdf, paint, codesum, cameras, qwen, history
    gui/        # Qt deck — fewer tiles, logical nav
    tui/        # Textual + tentacle Zack window (¼ screen)
    tentacle/   # node reference + hub tools (sync with OG home)
  data/         # DBs, queue, secrets stubs — unchanged paths preferred
  docs/         # human tutorial + mail protocol standard
  STAGING/      # experiments only; promote via PROOF then delete/archive
  DEVLOG.ai / DEVLOG.txt / VERSION
`
Legacy D:\pg\ai\nova-ai stays read-only heritage until diary/GUI deltas are absorbed.

### Build order (this week, token-aware)
1. **Log + map** (this entry + STAGING/FIELDKIT_2_0_REFACTOR_MAP.md) — done this cut.
2. **Mail protocol standard** — TCP frames + envelope verbs; update HEARTHBEAT doc; named tentacle identity (Tentacle-01 homage).
3. **Parser + speech prompts** — single peel path; GUI/TUI load GRAMMAR; one-sentence enforce.
4. **GUI deck prune** — hide aliases; dead tiles stay labeled or drop to overflow; fix nonlogical panels.
5. **Promote STAGING winners** — ingest_pipe, upgraded RAG, tentacle hub client, diary 0x-DOC hook — behind smoke tests.
6. **Zack tentacle TUI** — ¼ screen, ASCII monster, tophat temp/RAM/queue/ETA, slash cmds.
7. **Stress pack** — import smoke, job smoke, TTS peel, tentacle ping, no concurrent GPU thrash.
8. **Haul unpause** only after outbox→palace PROOF.

### Non-goals this cut
WhatsApp expansion, paper markets live, Android tentacle, rewriting NOVA.db schema casually, unpausing daily haul early.

### PROOF of this decision
- DEVLOG.ai + DEVLOG.txt + GrokBot.log.ai stamped
- FIELDKIT_2_0_REFACTOR_MAP.md present
- Next metal: do not mass-move files until map accepted and db backup noted

